@startuml
interface PaymentProcessor { + boolean pay(double amountUah); }
class BankTerminal {
  + int processPayment(int amountKopecks)
}
class BankTerminalAdapter implements PaymentProcessor {
  - BankTerminal terminal
  + boolean pay(double amountUah)
}
BankTerminalAdapter --> BankTerminal : adapts
note right of BankTerminalAdapter : Adapter
@enduml
